<tr>
  <td align="left">
    <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 16px;">Hi {{candidateName}},</p>
    
    <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 16px;">
      This is a quick update to let you know that your application for the <strong>{{jobTitle}}</strong> role at <strong>{{companyName}}</strong> has been opened and reviewed by the hiring team.
    </p>
    
    <p style="margin: 0 0 24px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #4a5568;">
      No further action is required from you at this time. You can monitor any future changes to your application status directly from your dashboard.
    </p>
  </td>
</tr>

<tr>
  <td align="center" style="padding: 30px 0;">
    <a href="{{dashboardLink}}" class="button" style="background: transparent; border: 3px solid #3301fa; border-radius: 36px; color: #3301fa; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; padding: 14px 48px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;">Go to Dashboard</a>
  </td>
</tr>

<tr>
  <td align="left">
    <p style="margin: 24px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #718096; font-style: italic;">
      We'll notify you if the recruiter decides to take the next steps with your application.
    </p>
  </td>
</tr>